>> title: Baguette
>> category: Breads
>> tags: bread, french, yeast, poolish, oven
>> counters: Bakery, Deli
>> aka: French bread, French stick
>> pairs-with: french-onion-soup
>> servings: 12
>> time: 16 hr
>> step.1: stir the poolish, rest 12 hours
>> step.2: mix to a soft dough
>> step.3: knead 8 min, rise 2 hours with folds
>> step.4: divide in three, shape, proof 45 min
>> step.5: slash, bake 475°F 25 min with steam

Stir @bread flour{1 1/4%cup}(165 g), @cool water{2/3%cup}(160 g), and @instant yeast{1/8%tsp}(0.4 g) together, then rest ~{12%hours}.

Mix @&(~1)poolish{} with @bread flour{2 1/2%cup}(335 g), @warm water{3/4%cup}(170 g), @instant yeast{1/2%tsp}(1.5 g), and @fine sea salt{2%tsp}(10 g).

Knead @&(~1)dough{} for ~{8%min}, then rise ~{2%hours}, folding twice.

Divide @&(~1)dough{} into three, roll into 14-in ropes, and proof ~{45%min}.

Slash @&(~1)baguettes{} and bake at 475°F with steam for ~{25%min}.
